Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.82-rt118 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.82 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: 1948d545fc2626e05a32767e4691363914f83fa6


Or to build 3.2.82-rt118 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.82.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.82-rt118.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

